><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">底位<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">도ˆ위ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">海角<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">해ˆ각</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">天邊<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">틸ˉ빌ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bo-lun-lì ti-tô-wī hâi-kak thḭ̄-pḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">代表<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">대ᄇᆤˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心意<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ이</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lông-si-tai-piâu-goà’e sīm-i\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">春風<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">춘ˉ헝ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">微微<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8e